    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "In the Court, learned counsel for the applicants only submitted that some direction be issued to the court concerned regarding bail as the applicants want to surrender before the trial court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 926,
      "end": 1118,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The application is, therefore, disposed of with the direction to the trial court that if the applicant appear before the trial court within three weeks from today and moves an application for bail before the trial court, the same shall be decided as soon as possible in view of law laid down in Satender Chandan Kishore And 3 Others vs State Of U.P. And Another on 22 May, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/22084408/\n1",
